1
00:00:00,050 --> 00:00:01,653
Back to the sal tree.

2
00:00:01,653 --> 00:00:08,736
Its xylem vessels form unbroken pipes from root to leaf, filled with a continuous thread of water.

3
00:00:08,736 --> 00:00:18,033
The accepted explanation is the cohesion tension theory of Dixon and Joly, from eighteen ninety-five, and it stands on three pillars.

